A||||35||Kelvin Vivian||Why do you like about your Fiero?||||5||
Z||000000||Kelvin Vivian||12-24-2001||03:06 AM||||What do you like about your Fiero?  What makes it special to you?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.printroom.com/_vti_bin/ViewImage.dll?userid=no_18&album_id=36084&image_id=1&courtesy=1"> <BR>1987 SE<P>This car is medium red metallic, it goes by the name "luscious" because of it's lipstick red color.  I like it because of it's options... It's a great commuter (my daily driver).<P>Specs:  4-cyl (easy to tune up), 5-spd (gets great gas mileage), performance sound (good sounds for cruising), manual windows and manual locks (keeps the car light), sunroof (pops out for some sun in CA), spoiler and twin pipe dual exhaust (looks and almost sounds like a V6 Fiero).  <P>Non-factory options I've added are: GT rims running 205-55-15s, a passenger visor with a vanity mirror, GT leather shift knob, holley side scoop, K&N air filter.<P>I just gave her new spark plugs and wires today, she didn't need a cap and rotor because she's distributorless.  Pontiac revised the Iron Duke a bit in 1987, and a lot more in 1988...||||reg||5
Z||000001||artherd||12-24-2001||03:27 AM||||It's a Ferrari for Fifteen Grand.  <P>What more do you want?!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>(PS: Some assembley required  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000002||Fierokid87||12-24-2001||10:23 AM||||Mid engine, never rusts accept frame which can be fixed, fast even with the 2.8, slick looking, Pontiac, original, rare, comfortable to be in.  Any thing else?<P>Scott<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="red"> Fierokid's  Web site:</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="white">http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero</FONT><P><FONT COLOR="blue">AIM: Fierokid87<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokid.gif"> ||||reg||1
