Z||000010||The Fieromaster||12-24-2001||01:37 PM||||Handling!!  NOTHING I have ever driven handles better... Well my dads 93 vette did but i didnt like how unpredictable it felt... I almost lost it on a corner that i normaly drive alot with my Fiero... I TOTALY could feel when my Fiero was at its limits!!<BR>Style... better lookin than most 80's cars!!  Price... afordable... normaly you can get a AWESOME one from someone who dont really know what they have for cheap!!<BR>And finaly... yes yes the car is WAY underpowered stock... specially if you got a 4cyl... BUT there are so many ways to make it faster!  James and I slid a 5 speed and a v6 into his auto 4 cylender in a weekend!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">        <FONT COLOR="red"><B>"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT></B>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/thefieromastersig.gif">    <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AOL IM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
