Z||000018||SLYGUY||12-25-2001||01:17 AM||||I've always loved the look of them. I love driving them also. The interior is very comfortable. Very personal. Your very own comfortable place to be, even during those spooky moments you look up at every car next to you.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Very fast, smooth, great V6 burbling exhaust. Where I live, I never see another one. I feel exclusive driving it. Feels like a million bucks each time. Kinda like the rush you get driving alone in your first car, the first time. I get that rush every time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly||||reg||1
