Z||000023||Spiff||12-25-2001||01:35 PM||||I like my Fiero because it's MINE. I bought it because I've wanted a Fiero since they first came out in 84. She's my baby. She shelters me from the elements. She helps me relax with a nice drive. She provides for me by taking me to work. That's why I like my Fiero.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spiffsig2_18.gif">  ||||reg||1
