Z||000033||SKIDMARK||12-25-2001||11:16 PM||||I like the 86 SE because it's my first REAL project car, it's got some nice goodies on it and looks cool. It's great when you pull up to the local charity corner car wash and they ask you "is that a Ferari?". What other car can you get for less than $1000 that gets so many looks on the road.<BR>I like the 85 coupe because even though it's my daily driver with 177K miles, I get that warm fuzzy excited feeling every time I get in it. People on the freeway linger in the next lane to give me a "thumbs up" when I glance over. The guys I work with liked it so much a couple of them went out and bought their own.<P> <IMG SRC="http://pstr-m03.ygpweb.aol.com/data/001/16/2D/87/EC/iDUubVYIXUBM4OxKod2NFVJc-1n-Wu8y0180.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>White '85 4cyl coupe<BR>Black '86 v-6 SE<BR>'81 CB900F Super Sport<p>[This message has been edited by SKIDMARK (edited 12-25-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000034||Elenor84||12-26-2001||01:39 AM||||I'm with 101...I love it cause its my first car...also because its faster and handles better then most of my friends cars...I love it because its 17 years old and still turns heads...I love it because of the wide range of stuff that can be done to it...<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Side1.jpg"> </A>||||reg||1
Z||000035||kneebarx||12-26-2001||10:58 AM||||I like the looks of it, although there are alot of other ppl that disagree, they're the kind thats all into the rice cars.  Its a very unique looking car, I can see it from a mile away!  It's pretty rare too, I used to like the rice cars, until I see that everyone has those damn things. This is the perfect car if you want a car thats looks great, but nobody knows about.  The v6 engine also sounds sweet!  It also has a lot more history to it than most cars.  I get a lot of comments about it too, which is weird since my car still look like crap, but even then, i still had compliments.  And theres sooOOoo many things you can do to it as far as customizing it.  It's also very cool when you're so low to the ground that you can't even see who's driving in the truck next to you!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
